==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|NL.|en}} {{term|lang=la|neuralgia}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|lang=grc|νεῦρον|tr=neuron||nerve}} + {{term|lang=grc|ἄλγος|tr=algos||pain}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{context|pathology|neurology|lang=en}} An acute, severe, intermittent [[pain]] that radiates along a [[nerve]].

====Synonyms====
* [[neuralgy]]
* [[neurodynia]]

====Hyponyms====
* [[sciatica]]

====Derived terms====
* [[neuralgic]]

